# Living Conundrum: "If you would draw a card while your library has no cards in it, skip that draw instead" (CR 121.6, the rulings): each draw is judged as it is made. Bot1's library holds two cards at turn 3, one after the
# draw step, and Ancestral Recall draws it and skips the other two: the hand is the two Islands, the library empty and the Conundrum 10/10.

